Package: carina
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Gabriel Moraes <gmateusmoraes@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), ca-certificates, libgl1, libglib2.0-0, libxkbcommon0, libcairo2, libmpv2 | libmpv1 | libmpv-dev, python3-gi, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Recommends: systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/gabriel-moraes/CARINA_CORE
Description: Controlled Artificial Road-traffic Intelligence Network Architecture
 CARINA is an industrial-grade adaptive AI urban traffic network architecture.
 It bundles sub-millisecond signal actuation, emergency vehicle preemption (EVP),
 local neural inference (including offline SLM model in Model_Vault),
 and a real-time web operational control center (CCO) vector map.
